# PERFORM (SEL): white 1-5 mute the Drone, the Sequence, the Lead, Sequence 2, the Atmosphere (their levels kept);
# white 7-11 held: Sweep, Open, Shut, Drop (both sequences out), Push; SEL or a page's button leaves
# (on Stratosfear: no Emerge, both sequences from the first bar)
wait 500
turn PRESET 4
wait 300
expect piece 4
listen
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
said PERFORM ON
# the Sequence muted (white 2): no note on channel 2
tapkey w1
wait 300
said SEQ
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 0
tapkey w1
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# Drop held (white 10): both sequences out, the Drone goes on
key w9 down
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 0
expect notes_ch4 0
key w9 up
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# a page's button leaves PERFORM
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
# (BERLIN) the keys follow the meters, left to right: white 4 Sequence 2 (the 4th meter), white 5 the Atmosphere (the
# 5th), the other untouched; a solo (black 4: Sequence 2) leaves the Atmosphere out too (Sunrain: Surf, both
# sequences; Sequence 2 heard: its meter above 2, a moment's reading, which Sunrain's 8/7 caught at 4)
turn PRESET 1
wait 6000
expect piece 5
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tapkey w4
wait 300
said ATMOS
expect mutes 32
wait 3000
expect act4 0
expect act3 >2
tapkey w4
wait 300
tapkey w3
wait 300
said SEQ 2
expect mutes 24
wait 3000
expect act3 0
expect act4 >5
tapkey w3
wait 300
tapkey b3
wait 300
said SOLO
wait 3000
expect act3 >2
expect act4 0
expect act1 0
tapkey b3
wait 3000
expect act4 >5
